[0.051107, "o", "\u001b[37;1m  Collection Name\u001b[0m: \u001b[90mWeaveImages\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37;1m  Vectorizer\u001b[0m: \u001b[90mnone\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37;1m  Properties\u001b[0m: \r\n    1. \u001b[37;1murl\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - the source URL or filename of the image\r\n    2. \u001b[37;1mimage\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - the image reference (truncated base64 or URL)\r\n    3. \u001b[37;1mimage_data\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - the base64 for the image\r\n    4. \u001b[37;1msource_type\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - metadata field: source_type\r\n    5. \u001b[37;1mai_summary\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - AI-generated summary of the document content\r\n    6. \u001b[37;1merror\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - metadata field: error\r\n    7. \u001b[37;1mexif\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - metadata field: exif\r\n    8. \u001b[37;1mtype\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - type of the document\r\n    9. \u001b[37;1mclassification\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - metadata field: classification\r\n    10. \u001b[37;1mdate_added\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - metadata field: date_added\r\n    11. \u001b[37;1mextraction_timestamp\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - metadata field: extraction_timestamp\r\n    12. \u001b[37;1mfile_size\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) -"]
[0.000018, "o", " metadata field: file_size\r\n    13. \u001b[37;1mformat\u001b[0m (\u001b[90mtext\u001b[0m) - metadata field: format\r\n    14. "]
